Per-game defaults shipped with Bridgeplay.

One file per game, named <steam appid>.conf (for example 1245620.conf), in KEY=VALUE form.
`make app-payload` bundles every *.conf here into the app, and the installer copies them
to ~/Library/Application Support/bridgeplay/gamefixes-default/, replacing the files there
each time. Overrides belong in ~/Library/Application Support/bridgeplay/gamefixes/, which the
app's Game Defaults page edits. The format is in docs/GAMEFIXES.md.

Example 1245620.conf:
  # Elden Ring
  BACKEND=wined3d
